  "autobiographical": [
    "In 2-3-74, PKD found wholeness in himself: Angel Archer, his completed self, ending his longing for women as missing parts.",
    "High school memory: left-brain hemisphere explained Archimedes' principle.",
    "PKD identifies as right-brain dominant, viewing left-brain people as cold machines/androids.",
    "Wrote Ubik ('BTA') with left hemisphere speaking in its own voice through Angel Archer.",
    "2-3-74 was a death-crisis moment when his left hemisphere took control, then joined his right in Ditheon.",
    "PKD describes himself like an American Indian defeated by modern urban life, but possessing Sedakah.",
    "Received 'messenger' dream revealing a spotless white sheet of paper (karmic nullification).",
    "Experience of schizoid women as representing his own missing anima, now internalized."
  ],
