  ],
  "symbols_images": [
    "Spotless white sheet of paper (Christ's karmic intervention, revealed in messenger dream)",
    "Xerox missive (trigger or artifact of 2-3-74 visionary experience)",
    "Iron filings responding to magnetic field (metaphor for how Corpus Christi perturbs reality field)",
    "American Indian facing modern white urban life (PKD's self-image as primitive/shamanic)",
    "Holy Fool interrupted by left-brain reason uttering wise sayings (archetypes of Ditheon)",
    "Schizoid android vs. Sedakah-bearing human (dichotomy of consciousness types)"
  ],
  "tensions": [
    "PKD oscillates between claiming 2-3-74 was literal divine grace vs. psychological/neurological awakening—both frames present.",
    "He corrects Pat on schizophrenia diagnosis while acknowledging his state 'was like a psychosis; very much so'—trying to preserve non-pathological reading.",
    "Claims his writing ability comes from buried left hemisphere, yet he is right-brain dominant—invokes split consciousness to resolve.",
    "Ditheon supposedly disappeared when right-brain-dominant people ceased being born, yet PKD claims to embody it—implicit claim of biological anomaly or historical rupture unexplained.",
    "Proposes info-processing speed varies by psyche type (A, B, C) but never defines the types or their criteria.",
    "Asserts St. Sophia as collective archetype while treating her as future historical entity ('will be born again')—mixes metaphysics and prophecy.",
    "Ends fragment on negentropy/organism survival, seemingly abandoning Ditheon theology for thermodynamic abstraction."
  ],
  "evidence_quotes": [
    "Ditheon: Christ enters the mind of the creature confronting retributive fate (the death crisis) & confronts it with him, & by the insertion of his own spotless white sheet of paper—as revealed to me in my 'messenger' dream, nullifies the claim, karmic claim, that the retributive fate has on the creature.",
    "Apotheosis! Is this not perhaps the ultimate gift that religion can bestow? On its journey across to the next world, its God accompanies it.",
    "The true Xtian is Ditheon: the Sedakah of the right brain & the logic of the left. (As in Philo.)",
    "2-3-74 was not just my left hemisphere invading but was—as a result of this invasion—'Ditheon' or 'baptized in the spirit' as was possible in apostolic times: the logic of the left hemisphere & the Sedakah of the right hemisphere producing a God-like dual entity in touch with collective—phylogenic—wisdom.",
    "But in 2-3-74 I found it in myself; this is Angel Archer, my completed self. My longing for wholeness."
  ],
